Paste this into limine.conf (Replace UUIDs with blkid results):

```bash

timeout: 3

/Gentoo Linux
    protocol: linux
    kernel_path: boot():/vmlinuz
    module_path: boot():/initrd
    cmdline: rd.luks.uuid=YOUR_LUKS_UUID root=UUID=YOUR_BTRFS_ROOT_UUID rootfstype=btrfs rootflags=subvol=@ lsm=landlock,lockdown,yama,integrity,apparmor,bpf rw
```

Install Kernel & Register Bootloader:

```bash
emerge --ask sys-kernel/gentoo-kernel
emerge --ask sys-boot/efibootmgr
efibootmgr --create --disk /dev/nvme0n1 --part 1 --label "Gentoo Limine" --loader /EFI/Gentoo/limine.efi
```

